{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"To factor means to rewrite an expression as a product. Let's try dividing the expression $24j-16$ by each factor.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $8$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}24j-16\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=8\\left( \\dfrac{24j-16}{8}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=8\\left( \\dfrac{24j}{8}-\\dfrac{16}{8}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=8(3j-2)\n\\end{align}$\n\nYes, $24j-16$ is equivalent to $8(3j-2)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $6$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}24j-16\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=6\\left( \\dfrac{24j-16}{6}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=6\\left( \\dfrac{24j}{6}-\\dfrac{16}{6}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=6\\left(4j-\\dfrac{8}{3}\\right)\n\\end{align}$\n\nNo, $24j-16$ is *not* equivalent to $6(4j-2j)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $4$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}24j-16\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=4\\left( \\dfrac{24j-16}{4}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=4\\left( \\dfrac{24j}{4}-\\dfrac{16}{4}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=4(6j-4)\n\\end{align}$\n\nYes, $24j-16$ is equivalent to $4(6j-4)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $2$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}24j-16\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=2\\left( \\dfrac{24j-16}{2}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=2\\left( \\dfrac{24j}{2}-\\dfrac{16}{2}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=2(12j-8)\n\\end{align}$\n\nNo, $24j-16$ is *not* equivalent to $2(12-8)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"The following expressions are equivalent to $24j-16$:\n\n- $8(3j-2)$\n- $4(6j-4)$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"**Factor $24j-16$ to identify the equivalent expressions.**\n\n[[☃ radio 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $24j-16$.","content":"$8(3j-2)$","correct":true},{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $24j-12j$.","content":"$6(4j-2j)$","correct":false},{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $24j-16$.","content":"$4(6j-4)$","correct":true,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false},{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $24-16$.","content":"$2(12-8)$","isNoneOfTheAbove":false}],"countChoices":true,"deselectEnabled":false,"displayCount":null,"hasNoneOfTheAbove":false,"multipleSelect":true,"randomize":false},"static":false,"type":"radio","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
